   Networks-CENET-Annual, Hefei, PEOPLES R CHINA, OCT 17-19, 2025},
Abstract = {The transformation process of the industry into a more digitized world
   is a key challenge of the Fourth Industrial Revolution. On the one hand,
   the advantages of new technologies must be used profitably, on the other
   hand, the workforce needs to be prepared to deal with new technologies
   and the complexity and speed that today's production entails {[}1].
   Based on AIoT technology, this project constructs an innovative
   intelligent operation system for the whole scene of smart cafes. This
   system employs multiple technologies such as ZigBee wireless sensor
   networks, AI-based visual recognition, and voice interaction. In this
   way, multiple functions such as real-time environmental monitoring,
   intelligent device status detection and customer preference analysis can
   be achieved. Externally, the CC2530 coordinator is adopted to build an
   energy-saving wireless sensor network, and Tmall Genie is used as the
   hub for voice interaction. The integration of multi-mode data is
   realized through Ali Cloud platform. The Boa server will provide a
   visual web interface, and the artificial intelligence algorithm can
   automatically adjust the temperature and humidity. It can also adjust
   lighting, check employee contracts and learn about customer preferences.
   The system is designed to provide a replicable technical framework for
   the intelligent transformation of the catering industry.},
