   Dai, Minghui, Donghua Univ, Sch Comp Sci \& Technol, Shanghai 201620, Peoples R China.
   Mohiuddin, Samra, CMPak Ltd Zong 4G, Digital Technol, Islamabad 44000, Pakistan.
