Abstract = {The fast growth of Internet of Things systems has transformed the way
   policy decisions are made based on the data produced by these devices.
   These data are prone to errors and anomalies and can present privacy and
   security issues which can affect policy decisions. Therefore, it is
   necessary that, at each layer of Internet of Things architecture, the
